  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is palm-size, with a turtle shell whose protruding surface is covered in crocodile scales. After refinement it flies to the back and forms a large scale insignia like a tattoo, from shoulder to waist, covering the whole back.",
        "chapters": [
          204
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Both Carapace Gu and Crocodile Strength Gu are rank two Gu worms from that hundred beast king. The Carapace Gu is almost dying when found. It is palm-size, with a turtle shell whose protruding surface is covered in crocodile scales.",
        "chapters": [
          204
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_crocodile_strength_gu",
          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Once refined, it flies to Fang Yuan’s back and forms a large scale insignia like a tattoo, running from shoulder to waist and covering the whole back.",
        "chapters": [
          204
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "As the name suggests, it enhances the defense of a Gu Master’s back.",
        "chapters": [
          204
        ],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Its defensive area is too small for Fang Yuan’s needs because it can only defend the back.",
        "chapters": [
          205
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He judges Carapace Gu and Crocodile Strength Gu both imperfect for him at rank one initial stage. He still keeps Carapace Gu because he needs personal defense while Sky Canopy Gu stays with Bai Ning Bing.",
        "chapters": [
          205
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_sky_canopy_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Inside the Bai Gu Mountain inheritance, he notes that Ribcage shield Gu could pair with Carapace Gu for front and back defense, yet he also expects Carapace Gu to be replaced. He chooses Flying bone shield Gu instead.",
        "chapters": [
          222
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "inh_white_bone_inheritance",
          "gu_ribcage_shield_gu",
          "gu_flying_bone_shield_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
